    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "在给定幅值曲线下，‘最小相位’系统（即所有零点均位于左半平面）产生的相关相角净变化最小（如 G1 所示），相比之下非最小相位系统产生的相角变化更大（如 G2 的相角所示）。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "A 'minimum-phase' system (i.e., all zeros in the LHP) with a given magnitude curve will produce the smallest net change in the associated phase, as shown in G1, compared with what the nonminimum-phase system will produce, as shown by the phase of G2.",
